.anchor
# target/ is build output EXCEPT the IDL: target/idl/nuvem_vault.json is
# COMMITTED because it describes the one fixed program deployed on mainnet —
# the supervisor loads it explicitly, and a Railway clone without it cannot
# start. gitignore cannot re-include below an excluded dir, hence the ladder.
target/*
!target/idl/
target/idl/*
!target/idl/nuvem_vault.json
node_modules
test-ledger
.DS_Store
scripts/.local
.env.mainnet
